# HackerRank – Developer Hiring & Skills Platform with Online Coding Tests and Technical Interviews

HackerRank is the leading platform for hiring software engineering talent and developer upskilling. Features include automated screening tests, real-time pair programming interviews with an AI-assisted IDE, certified skill assessments, AI plagiarism detection, and deep ATS integrations.

HackeRank is also home to the largest and most active developer community  dedicated to learning programming skills and technical interview preparation.

Companies use HackerRank to assess, interview, and hire engineering talent with real coding challenges and expertly curated technical interview questions.

Developers use HackerRank to learn, compete in coding contests, earn certifications, and land jobs by showcasing verified skills.

## HackerRank Home Page

- [HackerRank](https://www.hackerrank.com/): Explore HackerRank’s full suite of developer hiring, skill evaluation, and talent branding solutions or join the leading free Developer Community to practice your coding skills and earn verified certifications.

